# Windsurf repository guidance

Follow the repository-wide [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for architecture, source-of-truth order, workflow, safety boundaries, and verification. The maintained documentation index is [docs/README.md](docs/README.md).

Check the nearest workspace manifest, source, tests, and configuration before changing code. Do not treat plans in `sites/radio/plans/` as approved requirements without confirmation.

When asked to capture or refine future work, follow [the refined backlog workflow](docs/backlog/README.md). Revalidate linked context when picking up a card and keep its index/status current.
